# =============================================================================
# CRITICAL: DO NOT DELETE THIS FILE
# =============================================================================
#
# This file configures CORS headers for static assets served by Cloudflare CDN.
#
# WHY IT'S NEEDED:
# Apps SDK renders widgets in a sandboxed iframe at:
#   *.web-sandbox.oaiusercontent.com
#
# Static assets (JS, CSS, fonts) are served directly by Cloudflare's CDN,
# bypassing our Worker code entirely. Without this file, the CDN serves
# assets without CORS headers, causing browsers to block cross-origin requests.
#
# WHAT HAPPENS IF DELETED:
# - Production widget gets stuck on skeleton loader
# - Browser console shows: "Access to script blocked by CORS policy"
# - Error: "No 'Access-Control-Allow-Origin' header is present"
#
# The Worker's middleware DOES NOT help here because static assets never hit
# the Worker - they're served directly by the CDN.
#
# Reference: https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/headers/
# =============================================================================

/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Access-Control-Allow-Methods: GET, POST, OPTIONS
  Access-Control-Allow-Headers: Content-Type, Authorization, X-Requested-With
  Access-Control-Max-Age: 86400
